# Button copy — no ellipses

Do not use ellipses (`…` or `...`) in button labels. Prefer a complete verb or verb phrase; the dialog or next step conveys that more input follows.

Examples: Grant, Deny, Release — not Grant…, Deny..., Release….

See `design.md` → UI copy → Buttons.
